1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Open the ProduceFiles folder and find the C.AligningShoulderSims file in the FindTuning folder.

2
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
In the T-ShirtAligningShoulderSims file, drag it to the 3D or 2D window.

3
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Press the 5 on the keyboard to switch to the top view.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
In the 3D tool bar, select the surface length measurement virtual model tool on the virtual model tool.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Start creating a virtual tape, with the orange dots moving along the mouse cursor.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Press once along the shoulder line at the height of the shoulder, and then point the mouse cursor to the point.

7
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
The double-click has completed the virtual tape production.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,000
In the 3D tool bar, click on the left-click on the virtual model tape tool.

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Select the 3D model measurement tool.

10
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Click on the 3D clothing line.

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The bar becomes transparent.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Then click on the virtual measurement created earlier.

13
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,000
The two lines are shown in red.

14
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
The 3D clothing line will move and stick to the virtual model measurement line.

15
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,000
In the 3D tool bar, select the move tool.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,000
If the T-shirt line is far from the actual line, the clothing will shake sharply and may cause the wear effect to be unfavorable.

17
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,000
In the simulated state, gently pull the clothing until it fits the virtual model.

18
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:47,000
In the 3D tool bar, select the improve clothing quality tool.

19
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,000
In the 3D tool bar, click OK.

20
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Activate the simulation.

21
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
In the 3D tool bar, select the edit measurement virtual model tool.

22
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
According to the need to rotate the virtual model, you can clearly see the virtual measurement on the shoulder.

23
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Click on the virtual measurement line, then click on the delete button on the keyboard.

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Activate the simulation.

25
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,000
The 3D tool bar will move and stick to the internal самой.

26
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Then click on the 3D tool bar, click on the 3D tool bar, and then click on the 3D movement.

27
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,000
When you click on the 3D tool bar, the 3D model will change.

28
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:35,560
The 3D model will move and stick to the internal

29
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Draw a 3D model.

30
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,000
The CAD model will move.

31
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Cards can be selected by clicking on the T-shirt.

